WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.000
ZQK is a cellular microkernel operating system engineered for autonomous multi-agent orchestration and human hybrid teams.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:18.300
It moves agent infrastructure away from ephemeral prompt loops into a deterministic, high-assurance substrate built natively in Go.

3
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:29.500
Current agent harnesses treat LLMs as trusted executors running loose scripts against uncurated vector databases.

4
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:39.800
Without memory boundaries or transactional isolation, a single hallucinating agent can corrupt shared context, destroy codebase integrity, and derail the entire swarm.

5
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:48.500
ZQK is structured across three core pillars: First, a Bring-Your-Own-Agent swarm plane that connects Claude Code, Cursor, and custom models via standard protocols.

6
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:57.500
Second, an out-of-band Go microkernel core that enforces lifecycle governance without latency overhead.

7
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:05.200
And third, a zero-lock POSIX filesystem as the single source of truth.

8
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:16.800
Within ZQK, agents operate exclusively inside PlaneDraft—a sandboxed, untrusted memory space. Agent proposals cannot mutate project state directly.

9
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:29.200
They must pass through the Cellular Membrane, which validates structural schemas before any mutation can be staged or promoted into the authoritative knowledge graph.

10
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:40.800
Rather than hoping an LLM follows instructions, ZQK enforces non-negotiable invariant gates.

11
00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:51.500
State transitions require cryptographic ActorAttestation confirming the agent's identity, and ParentHash causal lineage. If an invariant cannot be proven, the gate fails closed in microseconds.

12
00:01:52.500 --> 00:02:02.500
When an agent drifts off-specification or fails invariant checks, ZQK triggers cellular apoptosis.

13
00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:13.900
The faulty draft state is quarantined and rolled back to the last known stable cryptographic snapshot. The failure is contained entirely within the individual cell, preserving the health of the broader organism.

14
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:24.200
As systems scale, specialized microkernels federate into a living organism.

15
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:34.200
Neuron cells route intent and sensory feedback; Muscle cells drive heavy compute; Heart cells maintain state persistence; and Brain cells govern strategy and alignment across the enterprise mesh.

16
00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:45.500
ZQK follows the proven operating system model. The single-node core microkernel, CLI, and local memory planes are 100% open-source under Apache 2.0.

17
00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:56.800
Distributed peer discovery, multi-tenant policy enclaves, and enterprise compliance clustering form the commercial Enterprise Mesh.
